    "detailed_description": "It's rafting time! Rafting Frenzy is a 2D top-down rafting game and it's the second game of the new LGV Sports Frenzy collection. With two modes, racing and free rafting (survival), and a lot of obstacles and powerups to boost your run on either mode, you're going to need to count both on your luck and skill to reach for a big score!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&gt; Main features:<br />\r\n- Racing mode with 3 different options: 16, 32 and 64 checkpoints;<br />\r\n- Free rafting (survival);<br />\r\n- Powerups that might increase or reduce your speed and grant temporarily invincibility.<br />\r\n- Retro-style graphics;<br />\r\n- Procedurally generated map;<br />\r\n- Random obstacles, such as crocodiles, rocks and water currents.",
